<para>A callable <computeroutput>(int A, <ref refid="struct_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_meshfree_1_1_stiffness_of_node" kindref="compound">StiffnessOfNode</ref>&amp; ofNode)</computeroutput> that adds the stiffness of node <computeroutput>A</computeroutput> to the (zeroed) <computeroutput>ofNode</computeroutput>, e.g. a particle&apos;s addStiffnessOfNode(). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
