<para>Add the stiffness of a particle to a matrix (<ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_meshfree_1_1_stiffness_assembler" kindref="compound">StiffnessAssembler</ref>, which the particle describes its stiffness to; see <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_meshfree_1_1_particle_1aab0d22df342729365537585c8b3a6517" kindref="member">Particle::describeStiffness()</ref> for the state it is of): the tangent of computePhysicsKernels() at a zero increment, without the inertia. The particle is left as it was found. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="inout">particle</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The particle (<ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_meshfree_1_1_particle_1aab0d22df342729365537585c8b3a6517" kindref="member">Particle::describeStiffness()</ref>). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="inout">K</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Column-major, nDof x nDof, in the dof order of the particle: the stiffness is added. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">timeNew</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
